{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "fCW4bUHSHQ", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-25", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1780, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760931, "segment_id": "uzPm4NVTM4", "segment_broadcast_id": "fCW4bUHSHQ", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Brian Williams (Boston)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760931, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "fCW4bUHSHQ", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-25", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1780, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760931, "segment_id": "kuedluue9Y", "segment_broadcast_id": "fCW4bUHSHQ", "segment_title": "Campaign 2004 / Bush vs. Kerry / Convention / Boston / Security", "segment_description": "(Boston: Brian Williams)  Report introduced. \n (Boston: Carl Quintanilla)  The wild week of the Democratic National Convention in Boston previewed; scenes shown from the Fleet Center as key Democrats & delegates arrive; details given of security concerns.  [Four BOSTONIANS\u00a0- comment on the security presence.] \n (Boston: Brian Williams)  Report introduced. \n (Boston: Rehema Ellis)  The controversy over the intense security in Boston for the convention featured; scenes shown of protests in the street & various security measures on the streets & the subway system.  [Protestor Dustin LANGLEY\u2020, war protester Audrey COLTER\u2021- express concerns.]  [Public safety director Edward FLYNN\u00a0- comments on protection.] \n (Boston: Brian Williams)  Report introduced. \n (Columbus, Ohio: Kelly O'Donnell)  Senator John Kerry's campaign in Ohio featured; scenes shown from Columbus, Ohio; details given of the lessons for the Democrats for this convention.  [KERRY\u00a0- campaigns.]  [Democratic pollster Peter HART\u00a0- hopes for an upbeat campaign.]  [July 12, KERRY\u00a0- criticizes President Bush's administration.]  Two examples of past convention time criticism noted.  [July 1992, former Texas Governor Ann RICHARDS\u2020- says George {Bush}was born with a silver foot in his month.]  [August 1992, former presidential candidate Pat BUCHANAN\u2020- criticizes Bill Clinton.] \n (Boston: Brian Williams)  Bush's vacation on his western ranch noted. \n (Crawford, Texas: Norah O'Donnell)  Bush's plans for a month-long offensive for a second term examined; scenes shown from the Texas ranch.  [Political analyst Charlie COOK\u2020- says the Bush campaign has to change the dynamics of the race.]  [On the campaign trail, BUSH\u00a0- speaks.]  [Presidential advisor David GERGEN\u2020- says the keys are the job count & the body count in Iraq.] \n (Boston: Brian Williams, Andrea Mitchell, Campbell Brown)  The impact of the subject of terrorism on the Democratic National Convention, the popularity of the report from the commission that investigated September 11 & the change in the number of electors since 2000 due to population changes in the South & the West discussed.", "segment_duration": 780, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760932, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "fCW4bUHSHQ", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-25", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1780, "br